{"seq":2,"slug":"ll-parsing","title":"LL 分析与预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/top-down/ll-parsing","wordCount":1263,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ll-分析与预测\">LL 分析与预测</h1><p><a href=\"recursive-descent\">递归下降</a> 里那句「看到当前 token，靠经验决定调哪个函数」，听上去随意，其实背后有一套可以精确计算、可以判定、可以表格化的理论。把这套理论提炼出来，就是 LL 分析。LL 的两个 L 分别表示：从左到右扫描输入（Left-to-right），构造最左推导（Leftmost derivation）。它回答的核心问题是：对一份文法，能不能只看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个前瞻 token，就在每个决策点上确定无误地选出唯一一条产生式？能，它就是 LL(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>) 文法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LL 分析是表驱动的预测分析。它不靠手写函数，而是用一张二维分析表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[A, a]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：行是非终结符 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，列是终结符 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>（当前前瞻 token），表项填的是「此时该用哪条产生式」。配一个显式的栈，解析就变成一个不递归的循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;栈顶 = 开始符号 S&lt;br/&gt;输入指向第一个 token&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;栈顶是终结符?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;与当前 token 匹配?&lt;br/&gt;匹配则双双弹出/前进&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|否 非终结符 A| D[&quot;查表 M A 当前token&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;取出产生式 A 到 alpha&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;弹出 A 把 alpha 逆序压栈&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G{&quot;栈空且输入结束?&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt; B&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[&quot;接受&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| B\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"栈顶 = 开始符号 S&lt;br/&gt;输入指向第一个 token\"] --&gt; B{\"栈顶是终结符?\"}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[\"与当前 token 匹配?&lt;br/&gt;匹配则双双弹出/前进\"]\n  B --&gt;|否 非终结符 A| D[\"查表 M A 当前token\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"取出产生式 A 到 alpha\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"弹出 A 把 alpha 逆序压栈\"]\n  C --&gt; G{\"栈空且输入结束?\"}\n  F --&gt; B\n  G --&gt;|是| H[\"接受\"]\n  G --&gt;|否| B</pre><p>这台机器就是带一个栈的下推自动机的具体形态——回顾 <a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">上下文无关文法</a> 里说的「CFG 对应带栈的 PDA」，LL 表正是给这个栈编程的方式。它和递归下降是同一件事的两种写法：递归下降把栈藏在函数调用栈里，LL 表把栈显式拿出来。</p>\n<p>驱动这台机器的循环很短，只有查表和压栈两步：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"parse():&#10;  栈 = [开始符号]; 输入指向第一个 token&#10;  while 栈非空:&#10;    X = 栈顶; a = 当前 token&#10;    if X 是终结符:&#10;      if X == a: 弹出 X; 前进一个 token      // 匹配&#10;      else: error(&quot;期望 X, 得到 a&quot;)&#10;    else if M[X, a] == X -&gt; Y1..Yk:&#10;      弹出 X; 把 Yk..Y1 逆序压栈               // 展开产生式&#10;    else: error(&quot;在 X 处遇到未预期的 a&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>parse():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  栈 = [开始符号]; 输入指向第一个 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while 栈非空:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    X = 栈顶; a = 当前 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if X 是终结符:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if X == a: 弹出 X; 前进一个 token      // 匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      else: error(\"期望 X, 得到 a\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else if M[X, a] == X -> Y1..Yk:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      弹出 X; 把 Yk..Y1 逆序压栈               // 展开产生式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else: error(\"在 X 处遇到未预期的 a\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"用-first-follow-构造分析表\">用 FIRST/FOLLOW 构造分析表</h2><p>分析表怎么填？全靠 <a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">上下文无关文法</a> 那一节定义的 FIRST 与 FOLLOW 集合。对每条产生式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，规则是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\in \\text{FIRST}(\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[A, a] = A \\to \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon \\in \\text{FIRST}(\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>FOLLOW</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\in \\text{FOLLOW}(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FOLLOW</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，也令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[A, b] = A \\to \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>直觉是：如果当前 token 可能是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的开头，就该选这条产生式；如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 可能为空，那么当前 token 是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 之后能跟的东西」时，也该选它（意思是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 这次推出空，直接结束」）。</p>\n<p>举例：对算术文法消左递归后的版本</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"E  → T E&#39;&#10;E&#39; → + T E&#39; | ε&#10;T  → F T&#39;&#10;T&#39; → * F T&#39; | ε&#10;F  → ( E ) | num\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>E  → T E'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>E' → + T E' | ε</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T  → F T'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T' → * F T' | ε</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>F  → ( E ) | num</span></span></code></pre></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>num</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FIRST}(F) = \\{(, \\text{num}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">num</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 26: …OW}(E&#x27;) = \\{), \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\text{FOLLOW}(E&#x27;) = \\{), \\</span></span>}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>。于是</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">。于是</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">。于是</span></span></span></span></span>M[E&#39;, +] = (E&#39; \\to +TE&#39;)<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>，而</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">，而</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，而</span></span></span></span></span>M[E&#39;, )]<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>和</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">和</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">和</span></span></span></span></span>M[E&#39;, $]<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>都填</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">都填</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">都填</span></span></span></span></span>(E&#39; \\to \\varepsilon)<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>。整张表填完，解析就是纯查表，时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">。整张表填完，解析就是纯查表，时间</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">。整张表填完，解析就是纯查表，时间</span></span></span></span></span>O(n)$。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ll-1-冲突与文法限制\">LL(1) 冲突与文法限制</h2><p>LL(1) 的「1」指只看一个前瞻 token。一份文法是 LL(1) 的，当且仅当上面构造分析表时<strong>没有任何一格被填进两条产生式</strong>——一旦某格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[A, a]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 想塞两条，就出现冲突，解析器在这格不知道该选哪条。</p>\n<p>冲突有两个根源，都在 <a href=\"../foundations/grammars-cfg\">文法改写</a> 里见过：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突类型</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>解法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FIRST/FIRST</td>\n<td>两条产生式 FIRST 相交</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FIRST}(\\alpha) \\cap \\text{FIRST}(\\beta) \\neq \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>提取左公因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FIRST/FOLLOW</td>\n<td>可空产生式的 FIRST 撞上 FOLLOW</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon \\in \\text{FIRST}(\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mtext>FOLLOW</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FIRST}(\\alpha) \\cap \\text{FOLLOW}(A) \\neq \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FOLLOW</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>改写文法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左递归</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to A\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>FIRST 计算时自包含</td>\n<td>消除左递归</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这也是为什么 LL 解析器对文法挑剔：左递归直接出局，左公因子要先提取。值得强调的是，LL(1) 文法一定是无二义的——但反过来不成立，很多无二义文法不是 LL(1)。悬空 else 就是个典型，它不是 LL(1)（也不是 LALR(1)），需要靠额外约定消歧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ll-k-ll-与现代解析器生成器\">LL(k)、LL(*) 与现代解析器生成器</h2><p>只看一个 token 不够时，能看更多。LL(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>) 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个前瞻 token，能区分更多文法，但分析表的规模随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 指数膨胀（列数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Sigma|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Σ∣</span></span></span></span></span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Sigma|^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），所以纯 LL(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>) 很少用大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>真正把 LL 推向实用前沿的是 ANTLR。它的 ANTLR3 用 LL(*)，ANTLR4（当前主流，2025 年仍在活跃维护，最新版本在 4.13 系列）改用 ALL(*)（Adaptive LL(*)）：不固定前瞻长度，而是在解析时动态地、按需地往前看任意多 token——本质上是在每个决策点临时启动一个子解析来分辨歧义，再缓存决策。这让 ANTLR4 能接受几乎任何无左递归的 CFG，还自动处理直接左递归，把「写文法」的门槛降到很低，代价是运行时比固定表驱动重一些。</p>\n<p>这与手写 <a href=\"recursive-descent\">递归下降</a> 形成对照：手写追求极致控制与错误信息，ANTLR 这类生成器追求「给一份文法就能跑」的开发效率。而下一章的 <a href=\"../bottom-up/lr-parsing\">LR 分析</a> 则走另一条路——用自底向上换取比任何 LL 都更大的文法覆盖面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LL 分析 = 从左扫描 + 最左推导，表驱动且预测式，是递归下降的形式化对应（栈从函数调用栈变成显式栈）。</li>\n<li>分析表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M[A,a]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 用 FIRST/FOLLOW 填：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FIRST</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FIRST}(\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FIRST</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定主分支，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 时用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FOLLOW</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FOLLOW}(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FOLLOW</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 兜底。</li>\n<li>LL(1) 当且仅当分析表无冲突；冲突来自 FIRST/FIRST 相交、FIRST/FOLLOW 相撞、左递归，分别用提取公因子、改写、消左递归解决。</li>\n<li>LL(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>) 看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 但表指数膨胀；ANTLR4 的 ALL(*) 用自适应前瞻接受几乎任意无左递归 CFG，以运行时开销换文法友好度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LL 分析与预测","id":"ll-分析与预测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用 FIRST/FOLLOW 构造分析表","id":"用-first-follow-构造分析表"},{"level":2,"text":"LL(1) 冲突与文法限制","id":"ll-1-冲突与文法限制"},{"level":2,"text":"LL(k)、LL(\\*) 与现代解析器生成器","id":"ll-k-ll-与现代解析器生成器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"递归下降","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/top-down/recursive-descent"},"next":{"title":"解析器组合子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/parsing-techniques/top-down/parser-combinators"}}